rf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 9 grids runs from 1951 to 2025, and July to August came in under 90% of normal in 33 of those 75 years. In 2025, July to August was 59% of normal on the middle of the grids and August to September was 70%. So far in 2026, January to February came in at 74% of normal there. Grid 27524 had its driest year in 1964 at 65% of normal.</p>"}
